TE-2350 Antigravity @VERSION@ - Windows x64

VST3: Copy the COMPLETE VST3/TE-2350 Antigravity.vst3 directory to:
  C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3
Then reopen your DAW and rescan. Preserve Contents and its subdirectories.
The installer folder may require administrator rights; building does not.

Standalone/TE-2350 Antigravity.exe is a developer preview, not an officially
qualified standalone audio-device product. Device routing and loopback safety
depend on the machine. VST3 is the supported distribution format for M13.

Factory presets (20), UI assets and DSP are embedded. No source checkout or
JUCE source is needed at runtime. No extra compiler-runtime DLL is required.
Windows 10/11 x64 is the current qualification scope. Package is unsigned.

User presets: JUCE userApplicationDataDirectory/TE-2350/Antigravity/Presets.
On Windows: %APPDATA%\TE-2350\Antigravity\Presets. Upgrades preserve it.
Use the preset browser for Save Preset As, Save, Rename, Delete, Import, Export
and Reload. DAW state embeds parameters and preset baseline independently.

Verify the ZIP using the external SHA256SUMS.txt; the internal SHA256SUMS.txt
covers every payload file. release-manifest.txt identifies the build.
See LICENSE, JUCE-LICENSE.md and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt before distribution.
